{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-cursor/src/reader.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:18:40.129196Z","id":"602d8026b01ee06f06f0cb67bea3b8a5100fcd76ecb659485f59229217b70104","body":{"detail":"Before (45cb679) the reader read only ItemTable.composer.composerHeaders, which Cursor 3.24 migrates into the composerHeaders table and deletes. Checked 2026-10-19 against a copy of a real Cursor 3.24.12 state.vscdb (resume-matrix baseline, migratedToTable=1, 2 table rows, no ItemTable key): list_composer_ids returned 0 heads before and 2 after (recency order). Both heads in that DB are empty drafts, so a full derive of a 3.24 conversation with bubbles is covered only by the synthetic 3.24-shaped fixture (reader tests), not a real one.","kind":"pass","span":{"start":{"line":61},"end":{"line":61},"content_hash":"07ce472c5cbcd084fd17e96bb7ee42b1861652b9432390e754e02330135b859e"},"summary":"Cursor 3.24 heads are read from the composerHeaders table, the legacy ItemTable key fills in","tags":["fix","cursor","pr/20","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-cursor/src/reader.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T21:29:10.330103Z","id":"08734aa059b5ea6e7b5356ad3f07528460d20909584c23e2a9d4a58c332b5e4b","body":{"detail":"Before (45cb679) the reader read only ItemTable.composer.composerHeaders, which Cursor 3.24 migrates into the composerHeaders table and deletes. Checked 2026-10-19 against a copy of a real Cursor 3.24.12 state.vscdb (resume-matrix baseline, migratedToTable=1, 2 table rows, no ItemTable key): list_composer_ids returned 0 heads before and 2 after (recency order). Both heads in that DB are empty drafts, so a full derive of a 3.24 conversation with bubbles is covered only by the synthetic 3.24-shaped fixture (reader tests), not a real one.","kind":"pass","span":{"start":{"line":64},"end":{"line":64},"content_hash":"07ce472c5cbcd084fd17e96bb7ee42b1861652b9432390e754e02330135b859e"},"summary":"Cursor 3.24 heads are read from the composerHeaders table, the legacy ItemTable key fills in","supersedes":"602d8026b01ee06f06f0cb67bea3b8a5100fcd76ecb659485f59229217b70104","tags":["fix","cursor","pr/20","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-cursor/src/provider.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-19T21:58:39.525749Z","id":"d1487b05d8b40f4f77e219cd68272fdbe24c0b617dd712df582fa7c12ac67d11","body":{"detail":"7a93457 stopped stamping agentBackend:\"cursor-agent\" because native Cursor 3.24 IDE chats carry none and a chat with it opens empty. This reader maps agentBackend to meta.producer.version, so every round_trip@*@cursor and writer@cursor now list paths[].meta.producer.version as lost (or no longer gained), key_paths -1 each; shed@cursor's same-format trip drops data.agentBackend. Accepted on purpose: the field was the projector's invention, not the source's. Reading it from _v (18) or leaving it absent is the open choice.","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":360},"end":{"line":360},"content_hash":"da91b154a3df040f3ddd3e174032518304c19e894e47716801ca5c4c546a0efb"},"summary":"producer.version is the composer's agentBackend, which the projector now writes only when configured, so a projected chat reads back with no producer.version (accepted with pr/38)","tags":["baseline","accepted-loss","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-cursor/src/agent_store.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T00:19:29.096586Z","id":"7a3ee7eb870ad67164b6d6179559fd7bf0a9a2b991acc3e273d26b23c9adbb41","body":{"detail":"Checked 2026-10-19 with no model and no login: path resume --harness cursor-agent wrote the store for -C in a temp HOME (CURSOR_CONFIG_DIR, CURSOR_DATA_DIR, AGENT_CLI_CREDENTIAL_STORE=memory, NO_OPEN_BROWSER=1), and cursor-cli 0-unstable-2026-08-11's 'cursor-agent ls' under a pty listed it by title. Not checked: that 'cursor-agent --resume <id>' sends the field-1 ModelMessage history to the model, and whether the CLI needs any of ConversationStateStructure fields 3-39 or UserMessage fields beyond text/message_id. The live check (resume cell plus a random-id negative control) is in pr/58-cursor-agent-resume.md and needs CURSOR_API_KEY.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":28},"end":{"line":28},"content_hash":"cb8606522ddf62bd9914d56405d5bd625b6aa62e91db16e00583d02e8d707641"},"summary":"cursor-agent lists a written chat; that a resumed chat's model sees the history is unchecked","tags":["cursor","cursor-agent","pr/58","live-check-pending","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/toolpath-cursor/src/provider.rs","issuer":"mailto:1240090+bdelanghe@users.noreply.github.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T20:37:00.121612Z","id":"c2fc328b61851e204d7333d3a591f938b6fcc35d10520b5cd8acdea818493386","body":{"detail":"7a93457 stopped stamping agentBackend:\"cursor-agent\" because native Cursor 3.24 IDE chats carry none and a chat with it opens empty. This reader maps agentBackend to meta.producer.version, so every round_trip@*@cursor and writer@cursor now list paths[].meta.producer.version as lost (or no longer gained), key_paths -1 each; shed@cursor's same-format trip drops data.agentBackend. Accepted on purpose: the field was the projector's invention, not the source's. Reading it from _v (18) or leaving it absent is the open choice.","kind":"comment","span":{"start":{"line":371},"end":{"line":371},"content_hash":"da91b154a3df040f3ddd3e174032518304c19e894e47716801ca5c4c546a0efb"},"summary":"producer.version is the composer's agentBackend, which the projector now writes only when configured, so a projected chat reads back with no producer.version (accepted with pr/38)","supersedes":"d1487b05d8b40f4f77e219cd68272fdbe24c0b617dd712df582fa7c12ac67d11","tags":["baseline","accepted-loss","session:claude-code:729d6bb8-59f0-4ddf-892e-603372433260","session:claude-code:a69c02ae-2421-41a9-88c7-35c5942b4c1f"]}}
